     2	
     3	Composes each episode as: 1 language-specified TARGET + N distractors, with
     4	>=2 distractors visually similar to the target (design §5.1/§6.3), co-located on
     5	the same road segment so they are actually co-visible from the UAV. Supports
     6	multiple target classes (car / motorcycle / scooter / bicycle / pedestrian).
     7	"""
