  1047	    def force_target_evade(self, elapsed: float, duration: float) -> None:
  1048	        """§11: at loss-window onset, force the target to TURN at the upcoming junctions
  1049	        (set_route) so it leaves the UAV's forward view. A pure forward sprint does NOT work
  1050	        (target just gets far & small while staying in the forward frame, and the gap becomes
  1051	        un-re-acquirable); a TURN makes the target go off-frame while staying CLOSE, so the
  1052	        intercepting UAV must cut across and can re-acquire → genuine long loss + intercept."""
